108:
109:/* The Latch term below causes simulations to fail due to Unstable Outputs, converted to registered pin
110:LM16 =
111:  M16  &  BALE                             Enable M16 input 
112:# LM16 & !BALE                             Latch term **** Doesn't work reliably!
113:# LM16 &  M16;                             Deglitch term */
114:                              
115: 
116:DAEN2 = AEN2  &  HLDA;                     /* TIGHTEN UP ON HLDA */
117:                            
